[^2]: https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/LaTeX/Algorithms
[^3]: https://www.overleaf.com/project
[^4]: https://mirror.ox.ac.uk/sites/ctan.org/macros/latex/contrib/algorithm2e/doc/algorithm2e.pdf

